-- stdout --
flag provided but not defined: -bogus
Usage of demo fast-live:
  -address string
    	expected funder address; must equal the key's address
  -amount uint
    	utia the agent decides to send (default 1000)
  -explorer-block-url string
    	explorer block link template with {height}
  -explorer-tx-url string
    	explorer tx link template with {hash}
  -fund-timeout duration
    	how long to wait for funds before asking (default 5m0s)
  -funder-key string
    	key name in that keyring
  -funder-keyring-dir string
    	file keyring of an account you already have
  -funder-passphrase-file string
    	file (mode 0600) with the keyring passphrase; otherwise prompted without echo
  -headers-rpc string
    	CometBFT RPC for headers (untrusted)
  -home string
    	demo home directory; chain keys and run directories live here (default "<work>/home/.edicta-demo")
  -json
    	print one JSON event per line
  -max-recorder-funding uint
    	cap of one funding send to the run's Recorder account (utia); default 20000
  -max-total-funding uint
    	raise the lifetime funding cap (utia); asks for a confirmation
  -network string
    	network preset (default "mocha")
  -poll-every duration
    	poll interval while waiting (default 5s)
  -restart
    	stop the in-process edictad before the anchor lands and start it again
  -trust-root-api string
    	trust-root block API template with {height}
  -trust-root-page string
    	trust-root block page template with {height}
  -trusted-header string
    	HEIGHT:HASH from a source you choose, instead of the explorer
  -tx-rpc string
    	CometBFT RPC for the transaction and its proofs
  -yes
    	confirm --max-total-funding without asking; does not start the run
